{"ok": true, "summary": "Built a micro-channel heat exchanger core with 24 aluminium flat tubes, each 300 mm long with a 16 × 1.3 mm section, spaced at 8 mm pitch. Both tubes and simplified plain fins use InstancedMesh. Two Ø20 mm headers terminate the core, with Ø12 mm inlet and outlet connections on the left header. Unspecified details are assumed: rectangular tube corners, 0.25 mm tube walls, ten ports with 0.20 mm webs, 1 mm header and connection walls, and a central left-header baffle for two-pass routing. Fin pitch is measured along the tube length. Areas are gross geometric estimates, not rated thermal performance; aluminium mass includes headers, caps, baffle and connections but excludes braze alloy.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Micro-channel Core</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}\nh3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:15px}\n.legend{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:5px;border:1px solid #aaa}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;width:80%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:white;padding:15px}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Micro-channel heat exchanger</h3>\n<div>24 tubes · 300 × 16 × 1.3 mm · pitch 8 mm</div>\n<div>Fins: pitch 1.2 mm · thickness 0.1 mm</div>\n<div>Headers Ø20 mm · same-side ports Ø12 mm</div>\n<div id=\"areas\"></div>\n<div id=\"total\"></div>\n<div id=\"mass\"></div>\n<div><span class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#d4d9e0\"></span>Aluminium tubes, fins and headers</div>\n<div><span class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></span>Internal passages · section schematic</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Dimensions in mm; density in g/cm³.\n  tubes:24, tubeWidth:16, tubeHeight:1.3, tubeLength:300, tubePitch:8,\n  finPitch:1.2, finThickness:0.1,\n  headerDiameter:20, nozzleDiameter:12,\n  // Assumed internal construction and connection dimensions.\n  tubeWall:0.25, ports:10, webThickness:0.20,\n  headerWall:1, headerEndMargin:7.35, capThickness:1,\n  nozzleWall:1, nozzleLength:25, nozzleOffset:65,\n  baffleThickness:1, density:2.70, radialSegments:40,\n  explodeHeader:38, explodeFin:26\n};\nfunction showError(message){\n  const el=document.getElementById('error');\n  el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry{\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const pmrem=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);\n  scene.environment=pmrem.fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(200,400,300);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  const rotateButton=document.getElementById('rotate');\n  function syncRotation(){rotateButton.style.color=controls.autoRotate?'#b11f4b':'#333';}\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;syncRotation();});\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const tubeGroup=new THREE.Group(),finGroup=new THREE.Group();\n  const leftGroup=new THREE.Group(),rightGroup=new THREE.Group(),fluidGroup=new THREE.Group();\n  modelGroup.add(tubeGroup,finGroup,leftGroup,rightGroup,fluidGroup);\n  const metal=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#d4d9e0',metalness:0.85,roughness:0.35,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\n  const water=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#3b82f6',transparent:true,opacity:0.55,depthWrite:false,metalness:0,roughness:0.35});\n  const gap=P.tubePitch-P.tubeHeight;\n  const stack=(P.tubes-1)*P.tubePitch+P.tubeHeight;\n  const headerLength=stack+2*P.headerEndMargin;\n  const radius=P.headerDiameter/2,innerRadius=radius-P.headerWall;\n  const headerX=P.tubeLength/2;\n  const finLength=P.tubeLength-P.headerDiameter;\n  const finsPerGap=Math.floor(finLength/P.finPitch);\n  const finCount=finsPerGap*(P.tubes-1);\n  const portHeight=P.tubeHeight-2*P.tubeWall;\n  const portWidth=(P.tubeWidth-2*P.tubeWall-(P.ports-1)*P.webThickness)/P.ports;\n  const matrix=new THREE.Matrix4();\n  // Extruded port holes create actual hollow multi-port tubes.\n  const tubeShape=new THREE.Shape();\n  tubeShape.moveTo(-P.tubeWidth/2,-P.tubeHeight/2);\n  tubeShape.lineTo(P.tubeWidth/2,-P.tubeHeight/2);\n  tubeShape.lineTo(P.tubeWidth/2,P.tubeHeight/2);\n  tubeShape.lineTo(-P.tubeWidth/2,P.tubeHeight/2);tubeShape.closePath();\n  for(let j=0;j<P.ports;j++){\n    const x=-P.tubeWidth/2+P.tubeWall+j*(portWidth+P.webThickness);\n    const hole=new THREE.Path();\n    hole.moveTo(x,-portHeight/2);hole.lineTo(x,portHeight/2);\n    hole.lineTo(x+portWidth,portHeight/2);hole.lineTo(x+portWidth,-portHeight/2);hole.closePath();\n    tubeShape.holes.push(hole);\n  }\n  const tubeGeometry=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(tubeShape,{depth:P.tubeLength,bevelEnabled:false,steps:1});\n  tubeGeometry.translate(0,0,-P.tubeLength/2);tubeGeometry.rotateY(Math.PI/2);\n  const tubeMesh=new THREE.InstancedMesh(tubeGeometry,metal,P.tubes);\n  const finMesh=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(P.finThickness,gap,P.tubeWidth),metal,finCount);\n  const passageMesh=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(P.tubeLength,portHeight,portWidth),water,P.tubes*P.ports);\n  let index=0;\n  for(let i=0;i<P.tubes;i++){\n    const y=(i-(P.tubes-1)/2)*P.tubePitch;\n    tubeMesh.setMatrixAt(i,matrix.makeTranslation(0,y,0));\n    for(let j=0;j<P.ports;j++){\n      const z=-P.tubeWidth/2+P.tubeWall+portWidth/2+j*(portWidth+P.webThickness);\n      passageMesh.setMatrixAt(i*P.ports+j,matrix.makeTranslation(0,y,z));\n    }\n    if(i<P.tubes-1)for(let k=0;k<finsPerGap;k++){\n      const x=(k-(finsPerGap-1)/2)*P.finPitch;\n      finMesh.setMatrixAt(index++,matrix.makeTranslation(x,y+P.tubePitch/2,0));\n    }\n  }\n  for(const mesh of [tubeMesh,finMesh,passageMesh]){\n    mesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;mesh.computeBoundingSphere();\n  }\n  tubeGroup.add(tubeMesh);finGroup.add(finMesh);fluidGroup.add(passageMesh);\n  function ringGeometry(outer,inner,length){\n    const shape=new THREE.Shape();\n    shape.absarc(0,0,outer,0,Math.PI*2,false);\n    const hole=new THREE.Path();hole.absarc(0,0,inner,0,Math.PI*2,true);\n    shape.holes.push(hole);\n    const geo=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:length,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:P.radialSegments/2});\n    geo.translate(0,0,-length/2);return geo;\n  }\n  function cylinder(r,length,material,group,x,y,z,axis='y'){\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(r,r,length,P.radialSegments),material);\n    if(axis==='x')mesh.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    mesh.position.set(x,y,z);group.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  }\n  for(const [side,group] of [[-1,leftGroup],[1,rightGroup]]){\n    const shell=new THREE.Mesh(ringGeometry(radius,innerRadius,headerLength-2*P.capThickness),metal);\n    shell.rotation.x=Math.PI/2;shell.position.x=side*headerX;group.add(shell);\n    for(const sign of [-1,1])cylinder(radius,P.capThickness,metal,group,side*headerX,sign*(headerLength-P.capThickness)/2,0);\n    cylinder(innerRadius,headerLength-2*P.capThickness,water,fluidGroup,side*headerX,0,0);\n  }\n  cylinder(innerRadius,P.baffleThickness,metal,leftGroup,-headerX,0,0);\n  for(const sign of [-1,1]){\n    const x=-headerX-radius-P.nozzleLength/2;\n    const nozzle=new THREE.Mesh(ringGeometry(P.nozzleDiameter/2,P.nozzleDiameter/2-P.nozzleWall,P.nozzleLength),metal);\n    nozzle.rotation.y=Math.PI/2;nozzle.position.set(x,sign*P.nozzleOffset,0);leftGroup.add(nozzle);\n    cylinder(P.nozzleDiameter/2-P.nozzleWall,P.nozzleLength,water,fluidGroup,x,sign*P.nozzleOffset,0,'x');\n  }\n  // Gross areas exclude tube ends and fin edges; contact overlap is not deducted.\n  const tubeArea=P.tubes*2*(P.tubeWidth+P.tubeHeight)*P.tubeLength/1e6;\n  const finArea=finCount*2*gap*P.tubeWidth/1e6;\n  const tubeVolume=P.tubes*P.tubeLength*(P.tubeWidth*P.tubeHeight-P.ports*portWidth*portHeight);\n  const finVolume=finCount*P.finThickness*gap*P.tubeWidth;\n  const headerVolume=2*Math.PI*((radius**2-innerRadius**2)*(headerLength-2*P.capThickness)+2*radius**2*P.capThickness);\n  const nozzleVolume=2*Math.PI*((P.nozzleDiameter/2)**2-(P.nozzleDiameter/2-P.nozzleWall)**2)*P.nozzleLength;\n  const baffleVolume=Math.PI*innerRadius**2*P.baffleThickness;\n  const mass=(tubeVolume+finVolume+headerVolume+nozzleVolume+baffleVolume)*P.density/1e6;\n  window.__metrics=[\n    {label:'Tube outer surface area',value:tubeArea.toFixed(4),unit:'m²',note:'Gross perimeter × length; ends excluded'},\n    {label:'Fin area',value:finArea.toFixed(4),unit:'m²',note:'Both broad faces; fin edges excluded'},\n    {label:'Total heat-transfer area',value:(tubeArea+finArea).toFixed(4),unit:'m²',note:'Gross tube + fin area; not effective UA'},\n    {label:'Aluminium mass',value:mass.toFixed(3),unit:'kg',note:'Assumed walls; overlaps not deducted'},\n    {label:'Plain fin count',value:String(finCount),unit:'pcs',note:'233 per gap; 280 mm clear span'}\n  ];\n  document.getElementById('areas').textContent=`Tube / fin area: ${tubeArea.toFixed(4)} / ${finArea.toFixed(4)} m²`;\n  document.getElementById('total').textContent=`Total gross area: ${(tubeArea+finArea).toFixed(4)} m²`;\n  document.getElementById('mass').textContent=`Aluminium: ${mass.toFixed(3)} kg · ${finCount} fins`;\n  const box=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n  const center=box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n  const halfFov=THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(20);\n  const distance=size.length()/2/Math.sin(Math.min(halfFov,Math.atan(Math.tan(halfFov)*camera.aspect)))/0.70;\n  camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,0.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n  controls.target.copy(center);controls.update();\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(600,30,0xd8d3cb,0xe8e3db);\n  grid.position.y=box.min.y-5;scene.add(grid);\n  let section=false,exploded=false;\n  const plane=new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,-1),0);\n  document.getElementById('section').onclick=()=>{\n    section=!section;metal.clippingPlanes=section?[plane]:[];metal.needsUpdate=true;\n    finGroup.visible=!section;\n    document.getElementById('section').textContent=section?'Full view':'Section view';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{\n    exploded=!exploded;leftGroup.position.x=exploded?-P.explodeHeader:0;\n    rightGroup.position.x=exploded?P.explodeHeader:0;finGroup.position.z=exploded?P.explodeFin:0;\n    fluidGroup.visible=!exploded;\n    document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'Assembled view':'Exploded view';\n  };\n  rotateButton.onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;syncRotation();};syncRotation();\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;\n  window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{\n    camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n    renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  });\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n}catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "Tube outer surface area", "value": "0.2491", "unit": "m²", "note": "Gross perimeter × length; ends excluded"}, {"label": "Fin area", "value": "1.1490", "unit": "m²", "note": "Both broad faces; fin edges excluded"}, {"label": "Total heat-transfer area", "value": "1.3981", "unit": "m²", "note": "Gross tube + fin area; not effective UA"}, {"label": "Aluminium mass", "value": "0.414", "unit": "kg", "note": "Assumed walls; overlaps not deducted"}, {"label": "Plain fin count", "value": "5359", "unit": "pcs", "note": "233 per gap; 280 mm clear span"}], "suggestions": ["Compare fin pitches of 1.0, 1.2 and 1.5 mm for area and mass.", "Replace plain fins with louvered fins and specify louver angle and pitch.", "Refine header slots and brazed joints, then calculate net exposed area and aluminium mass."], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\nBuilt a micro-channel heat exchanger core with 24 aluminium flat tubes, each 300 mm long with a 16 × 1.3 mm section, spaced at 8 mm pitch. Both tubes and simplified plain fins use InstancedMesh. Two Ø20 mm headers terminate the core, with Ø12 mm inlet and outlet connections on the left header. Unspecified details are assumed: rectangular tube corners, 0.25 mm tube walls, ten ports with 0.20 mm webs, 1 mm header and connection walls, and a central left-header baffle for two-pass routing. Fin pitch is measured along the tube length. Areas are gross geometric estimates, not rated thermal performance; aluminium mass includes headers, caps, baffle and connections but excludes braze alloy.\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Micro-channel Core</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}\nh3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:15px}\n.legend{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:5px;border:1px solid #aaa}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;width:80%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:white;padding:15px}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Micro-channel heat exchanger</h3>\n<div>24 tubes · 300 × 16 × 1.3 mm · pitch 8 mm</div>\n<div>Fins: pitch 1.2 mm · thickness 0.1 mm</div>\n<div>Headers Ø20 mm · same-side ports Ø12 mm</div>\n<div id=\"areas\"></div>\n<div id=\"total\"></div>\n<div id=\"mass\"></div>\n<div><span class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#d4d9e0\"></span>Aluminium tubes, fins and headers</div>\n<div><span class=\"legend\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></span>Internal passages · section schematic</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Dimensions in mm; density in g/cm³.\n  tubes:24, tubeWidth:16, tubeHeight:1.3, tubeLength:300, tubePitch:8,\n  finPitch:1.2, finThickness:0.1,\n  headerDiameter:20, nozzleDiameter:12,\n  // Assumed internal construction and connection dimensions.\n  tubeWall:0.25, ports:10, webThickness:0.20,\n  headerWall:1, headerEndMargin:7.35, capThickness:1,\n  nozzleWall:1, nozzleLength:25, nozzleOffset:65,\n  baffleThickness:1, density:2.70, radialSegments:40,\n  explodeHeader:38, explodeFin:26\n};\nfunction showError(message){\n  const el=document.getElementById('error');\n  el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry{\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const pmrem=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);\n  scene.environment=pmrem.fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(200,400,300);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  const rot